usage: j3c run [path | file.j3 | tool.j3s] [--frames N] [--screenshot F.png] [--headless] [--hot] [--file] [--host] [--splash]
  --hot       rebuild and restart on .j3/.j3ui/.j3s edits; the old run stays up if the build fails (`j3c doc j3ui`).
  --headless  offscreen video, silent audio: no window. Agents always pass it (`j3c doc testing`).
  --host      ignore [emit] target: build and run an Android package for this machine, in place (`j3c doc testing`).
  --splash    show the startup splash in a dev run (`j3c doc ship`); same as J3_SPLASH=1
  --frames N  stop an App after N frames; --screenshot saves the last one (relative to your cwd).
--- stderr
--- exit 0
